[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14580.389, "timestamp": "04:03:00", "text": "想清楚了，我不用思考。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14582.229, "timestamp": "04:03:02", "text": "如果你也想了解的话，可以再问一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14583.269, "timestamp": "04:03:03", "text": "好的，请告诉我，我会发的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14585.67, "timestamp": "04:03:05", "text": "你有些东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14588.469, "timestamp": "04:03:08", "text": "我的朋友其实想让我……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14590.469, "timestamp": "04:03:10", "text": "共同投资和共同基金"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14591.99, "timestamp": "04:03:11", "text": "一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14594.87, "timestamp": "04:03:14", "text": "他说，这对你有好处。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14597.67, "timestamp": "04:03:17", "text": "未来之类的，我就想，呃，我会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14599.83, "timestamp": "04:03:19", "text": "尝试"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14604.389, "timestamp": "04:03:24", "text": "但我做不到，因为……嗯，好吧，继续。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14606.63, "timestamp": "04:03:26", "text": "我说过，共同基金是件好事，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14608.95, "timestamp": "04:03:28", "text": "这有点冒险，你需要做很多事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14611.189, "timestamp": "04:03:31", "text": "你需要正确的信息。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14614.07, "timestamp": "04:03:34", "text": "信息有效，然后你就可以了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14618.95, "timestamp": "04:03:38", "text": "说“是啊是啊”，嗯，我想做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14622.55, "timestamp": "04:03:42", "text": "确实如此，但我同时也感到害怕。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14624.389, "timestamp": "04:03:44", "text": "是的，这是件好事。害怕的。存在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14626.55, "timestamp": "04:03:46", "text": "害怕是件好事。这是最好的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14628.79, "timestamp": "04:03:48", "text": "可能会发生的事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14630.63, "timestamp": "04:03:50", "text": "不用担心。别担心，参议员。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14634.79, "timestamp": "04:03:54", "text": "开玩笑的。不用担心。是的。所以，呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14636.95, "timestamp": "04:03:56", "text": "你知道，在共同基金里，就是那个东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14639.11, "timestamp": "04:03:59", "text": "他们当时的想法是：“投资这个共同基金。”"}]